# Anchored to the repo root: this is the Next.js static-export directory.
# Unanchored, `out/` silently swallowed app/api/timeclock/out/ — an API route
# named "out" — which would have shipped a time clock with no clock-out
# endpoint. Any route segment legitimately named "out" must stay trackable.
/out/
